      284.76,
      441.96
    ],
    "text": "THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      441.44,
      286.68,
      615.16
    ],
    "text": "Notice Under Section 7 Ref. No.: THI/LND/L2/ACQVI/140. I hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose mentioned below:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406,
      17.998199462890625,
      19.91800880432129,
      23.997600555419922
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      616.63,
      286.72,
      735.92
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be Acquired: Following allotments of Lands containing in extent 0.4821 Hectare depicted as Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Survey Plan No. MR 2814 dated 03.09.2019 prepared by Senior Survey Superintendent of Matara District, situated in the Village of Andaledduwa, in Grama Niladari\u2019s Division of Uduwa East 333 in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Thihagoda Matara District, Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      431.84,
      540.13,
      487.76
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Manigewatta alias Managewatta; Description: Home Garden, Permanent building a part of a toilet, a well build with cement, mixed cultivation with jak, coconut trees aged about 50-60 years; Extent: 0.4821 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      497.6,
      539.85,
      622.88
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/Lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat of Thihagoda on the 28 day of November 2019 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20th day of November 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims of compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      632.24,
      531.72,
      665.84
    ],
    "text": "UMESHA SURANGI MATHARAGE, Divisional Secretary, Thihagoda.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
